From 84e3b16cfe678803303b44aa616d60ea2dffe21a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:37:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Implement bounded V2 byte and numeric VM operations

Complete the bounded P03 byte/string group and checked DIV, MOD,
MULPOW2, Boolean AND/OR, MIN/MAX, and WITHIN execution cases. Preserve
fail-closed dispatch for assigned operations still unsupported. Record all
215 assigned bytes in a pinned opcode-coverage inventory and check P05
static charges for the newly executed shapes. The VM API is unchanged.

Source provenance: isolated review commit
8d6576d6364e243a0d40fefe2e1953992721709c on base
67cb95ce6acdd3d766ae6113c143e50c0e838331; source tree
b639ffd90d5d9f856e1c5e680f6aec659e9d0cbd.
